<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/patients%20with%20HF> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasSourceMention> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_3756890c1e5fc6e4f303d0d69c5e6674192365d99b5559676ac7dc7c72e24ed8_n0012/e_0039> .
